\ @ID 08
\ @TITLE MINT SWING
\ @SUBTITLE 10.19.43 · 16% SWING JAZZ-SYNTH
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 4
\ @PART 1 Swing Kick + Bass
\ @PART 2 + Lead Hits
\ @PART 3 + Snare + Hats + Arp
\ @PART 4 Full 7-Voice Swing
\ @SPEED 2.0
\ @FORMULA sw=(floor(2x)+max(frac(2x)/1.16,(frac(2x)-0.16)/0.84))/2 [16% swing]

VARIABLE MS-B  VARIABLE MS-S  VARIABLE MS-N  VARIABLE MS-Q  VARIABLE MS-R
VARIABLE MS-KICK  VARIABLE MS-BASS  VARIABLE MS-SNARE  VARIABLE MS-HAT  VARIABLE MS-ARP  VARIABLE MS-LEAD  VARIABLE MS-HARM

: TRACK-EVAL ( x part -- )
  SWAP DUP 2.0 * DUP FRAC
  DUP 1.16 / SWAP 0.16 - 0.84 / MAX SWAP FLOOR + 2.0 /
  DUP FRAC MS-B !
  4.0 * DUP FRAC MS-S ! FLOOR >INT 32 + DUP MS-N ! 16 IMOD MS-Q !

  DUP 2.0 / FLOOR >INT 4 + 0 8 CLAMP 8 SWAP - 332255473 SWAP DIGIT 5 - MS-R !

  MS-B @ 0.18 < IF -26.0 MS-B @ * EXP 2.7 * MS-R @ DIAT F16 15.0 - 12.0 / + ELSE QUIET THEN MS-KICK !
  MS-B @ 0.24 >= MS-S @ 0.8 < AND IF MS-R @ DIAT F16 15.0 - 12.0 / ELSE QUIET THEN MS-BASS !
  1.0 - 2.0 MOD DUP 0.16 < IF 3.6 * 1.32 SWAP - ELSE DROP QUIET THEN MS-SNARE !
  MS-S @ 0.46 < MS-N @ 4 IMOD 2 >= AND IF 1.94 0.36 MS-S @ * - ELSE QUIET THEN MS-HAT !
  MS-S @ 0.8 < IF MS-R @ 3 MS-N @ 6 IMOD 3 - ABS - 2 I* + DIAT F16 3.0 - 12.0 / ELSE QUIET THEN MS-ARP !
  MS-S @ 0.78 < MS-Q @ 3 IMOD 0 = AND IF MS-R @ 6 + DIAT F16 9.0 + 12.0 / ELSE QUIET THEN MS-LEAD !
  MS-LEAD @ QUIET <> IF MS-LEAD @ 0.25 - ELSE QUIET THEN MS-HARM !

  CASE
    0 OF 2 VOICES-N! MS-KICK @ 0 PRIM-SINE  MS-BASS @ 1 PRIM-TRI ENDOF
    1 OF 3 VOICES-N! MS-KICK @ 0 PRIM-SINE  MS-BASS @ 1 PRIM-TRI  MS-LEAD @ 2 SHIM-PULSE-BELL ENDOF
    2 OF 5 VOICES-N! MS-KICK @ 0 PRIM-SINE  MS-SNARE @ 1 PRIM-NSE  MS-HAT @ 2 SHIM-HIHAT  MS-BASS @ 3 PRIM-TRI  MS-ARP @ 4 PRIM-SAW ENDOF
    7 VOICES-N! MS-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI  MS-ARP @ 1 PRIM-SAW  MS-LEAD @ 2 PRIM-SINE  MS-KICK @ 3 PRIM-SINE  MS-SNARE @ 4 PRIM-NSE  MS-HAT @ 5 SHIM-HIHAT  MS-HARM @ 6 PRIM-TRI
  ENDCASE ;
